{
  "bookId": "rewind-16",
  "id": "chapter-67",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "21328001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "喂小子，不想死的话，就滚远点！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "哦？呵，你以为你在跟谁讲话？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "笑吧，别忍着，趁现在你还能笑得出来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "呵呵，有意思，要我口吐芬芳？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "你最好收回那句话。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "我看你还是玩的不够脏。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "不不，看好，像这样——切，你还是玩的不够脏！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "——切，你还是玩的不够脏！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机甲兔",
          "text": "潇洒，狠，带劲儿！不愧是老大！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机甲兔",
          "text": "老大……我现在能从地上起来了吗……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "你是什么东西，轮到你说话了么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "杂碎，先回去掂掂自己几斤几两。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "别用「杂碎」，我们不良混混不说那种低劣的脏话，气势要狠，绝不能在人前跌了身份。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "有点东西，冲这句话，我认了你这个兄弟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "搞清楚身份，想跟我混，先叫大哥。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "愿赌服输，我打不过你，以后你就是我大哥。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机甲兔",
          "text": "大哥，老大，我想……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "闭嘴，躺好！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "克里斯，拿好球，你来试试看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "小菜一碟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "喂，兔子，你的头，三分球，迟早投进框里头。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "盖帽，快攻，上篮，绝杀——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "他们聚在一起嘀嘀咕咕的干什么呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "排演校园剧台词？就是不良少年欺负普通学生那一种，那个兔子在扮演好学生，你看，没错吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "喔你说的很有道理——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "太啰嗦了，像这样——哼，别逗我笑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "——哼，别逗我笑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21328028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "wooow，看起来还蛮像回事的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-402",
      "sourceRefs": [
