      ],
      "title": "《王子与乞丐》·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "21331001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "哎，你们学校的混混也是这么欺负人的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "想什么呢，我们可是正经学校，要说混混的话，隔壁「紫罗兰」学园大概就是这样的吧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "「Yolanda」学园。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331004",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "唔咦——！！！虫子吗？欧拉欧拉欧拉欧拉欧拉——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "什么人？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "被发现了，bad luck。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331007",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "砰——！！！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331008",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "藏头缩尾的鼠辈，滚出来受死吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "是我，my friend，真田君。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "说什么乱七八糟的东西，是你认识的人吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "笑话，我可不跟这种乖宝宝做朋友。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331012",
          "sourceType": 7,
          "text": "真田幸村 · 王子与乞丐\n商品名称：真田幸村·王子与乞丐 Ver.\n作品名称：《赤炎·境界》\n制造商：GALATEA 伽拉\n手办材质：ABS&PVC 涂装完成\n手办规格：1/7比例模型·附专用底座\n全高约255mm",
          "title": "角色介绍卡",
          "type": "profile"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Calm down，我们谈谈。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "少拽英文，我跟你没什么可说的，不想挨打就快走。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Never give up，一定会带你回去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331016",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "独眼龙小子，看在你眼罩不错的份上，就给你凑一对吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "喔——好像要打过来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21331018",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "就是你身上有我妹妹的味道吗，看招，阿~哒哒哒哒——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21335001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Dangerous，险胜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21335002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "呼，呼……真是强劲的对手……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21335003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "哈，哈……好久没这么有干劲了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21335004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "哼，还算有两下子，时间还长得很，我们慢慢玩儿。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21335005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克里斯",
          "text": "阿，你的后脚，是准备逃跑吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21335006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "少看不起人了，啊哈，放马过来，决一死战！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21335007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "哎尤娜，我们的任务是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21335008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "就是现在，run，快跑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21335009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "喂喂喂——别拉我阿——哎哎哎——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21335010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "我答应过和江的，再打下去要出大事……不管了，先跑再说吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-403",
      "sourceRefs": [
